"B<float nextdownf(float >I<x>B<);>\n"
"B<long double nextdownl(long double >I<x>B<);>\n"
msgstr ""
"B<double nextdown(double >I<x>B<);>\n"
"B<float nextdownf(float >I<x>B<);>\n"
"B<long double nextdownl(long double >I<x>B<);>\n"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
